:0}]"},{"id":807,"title":"情书 Love Letter","ratingNum":8.9,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 98% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2648230660.webp","tag":"No.66豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 日本","years":"1995","date":"1999-03(中国大陆)、2021-05-20(中国大陆重映)、2025-05-20(中国大陆重映)、1995-03-25(日本)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2494705863.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2494705877.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2494705966.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2494705955.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2494705888.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2648230660.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p449897379.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2192218939.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2652200106.webp\"]","descs":"日本神户某个飘雪的冬日，渡边博子（中山美穗）在前未婚夫藤井树的两周年祭日上又一次悲痛到不能自已。正因为无法抑制住对已逝恋人的思念，渡边博子在其中学同学录里发现“藤井树” 在小樽市读书时的地址时，依循着寄发了一封本以为是发往天国的情书。\n　　不想不久渡边博子竟然收到署名为“藤井树（酒井美纪）”的回信，经过进一步了解，她知晓此藤井树是一个同她年纪相仿的女孩，且还是男友藤井树（柏原崇）少年时代的同班同学。为了多了解一些昔日恋人在中学时代的情况，渡边博子开始与女性藤井树书信往来。而藤井树在不断的回忆中，渐渐发现少年时代与她同名同姓的那个藤井树曾对自己藏了一腔柔情。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1nj9Q62pLFbMdyUokZFt3-w?pwd=28bt\",\"size\":\"3.72\",\"date\":\"2025-07-28\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1247,"title":"花样年华 花樣年華","ratingNum":8.8,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 98% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2918312477.webp","tag":"No.129豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国香港","years":"2000","date":"2000-11-24(中国大陆)、2025-02-14(中国大陆·导演特别版)、2000-09-29(中国香港)、2000-05-20(戛纳电影节)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2603766413.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1974772440.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2160161321.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p975350262.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2287659682.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1910828286.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2917498801.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2323130195.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2516477520.webp\"]","descs":"1960年代的香港，报馆编辑周慕云（梁朝伟 饰）与太太搬进一间住户多是上海人的公寓，和某家日资公司的贸易代表陈先生与太太苏丽珍（张曼玉 饰）成了邻居。因为发现各自在外工作的配偶背着他们有了婚外情，周慕云和苏丽珍开始见面商讨未来可能发生的事情以及相应对策。\n　　起初两人是君子之交淡如水就事谈事，可是日子一日接一日过去后，在周围一帮上海邻居的闲言碎语中，他们发现配偶的事早空出了他们的脑袋，彼此眼里只剩下了对方，而刻意回避已生出的感情的结果，是更加刻骨的相思。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1H3Otkxtu1wVJOnG-Gx6slw?pwd=p45s\",\"size\":\"0.669\",\"date\":\"2025-08-10\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1216,"title":"柏林苍穹下 Der Himmel über Berlin","ratingNum":8.7,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 95% 奇幻片\n好于 92% 剧情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p792520149.webp","tag":"第40届戛纳电影节获奖名单","address":" 西德 / 法国","years":"1987","date":"1987-09-23(法国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2578518992.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2654737612.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2646665538.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2646665533.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2916014712.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p792520149.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2631292544.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2916018145.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2916018143.webp\"]","descs":"柏林由两位天使守护着，一个是对人世疾苦冷眼旁观的卡西尔，另一个是常常感怀于人类疾苦的丹密尔（布鲁诺•甘茨 Bruno Ganz 饰）。二人穿着宽大的天使袍，在城市各处游荡，倾听人们的祈祷，默默观察人们的内心世界。马戏团玛瑞安（苏韦戈•多马丁Solveig Dommartin 饰）的心事引来了丹密尔的同情，因为马戏团经营不善，面临倒闭，玛瑞安满心烦恼。这个马戏团的天使演员令丹密尔动了凡心，他决定化作凡人，追求一段美满感情。\n　　本片荣获1987年第40届戛纳国际电影节最佳导演奖。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Cm1ltMBuAz7UoSHHZ8WB-w?pwd=b9ru\",\"size\":\"\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":0}]"},{"id":1222,"title":"给朱丽叶的信 Letters to Juliet","ratingNum":7.6,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 84% 剧情片\n好于 90% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p546362391.webp","tag":"喜剧,剧情,爱情","address":" 美国","years":"2010","date":"2010-05-14","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p489407795.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p489448982.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p489452050.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p489404536.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p456746896.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p546362391.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2359296431.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1193846824.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1193846549.webp\"]","descs":"苏菲·霍尔（阿曼达·塞弗里德 Amanda Seyf 饰）是《纽约客》的调查员。她的未婚夫维克多为开餐馆忙碌着。他们来意大利的维罗纳旅行。不过，维克多却醉心于品尝美食，对她疏于照顾。两人感情因此矛盾丛生。苏菲闲逛到许愿墙下，发现很多人给朱丽叶写信。她很好奇，尾随取信的 妇女，发现有四位女士扮演朱丽叶，回信解答情感问题。苏菲被感动了，决定加入她们的队伍。她读到一封50年前的来信：克莱尔·史密斯（瓦妮莎·雷德格瑞夫 Vanessa Redgrave 饰）讲述了一段留有遗憾的当年情。苏菲用心地回了信。没想到，某天，老人的孙子查理（克里斯·艾根 Chris Egan 饰）找上门来。她这才了解，老人读了她的信，决定重拾真爱。但查理觉得这很荒谬。在争执中，三个人共同踏上了寻爱之旅…… ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1Ehr22490SQ78j6f8syXDDg?pwd=25x9\",\"size\":\"0.7\",\"date\":\"2025-08-07\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1258,"title":"战略高手 Out of Sight","ratingNum":6.4,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 24% 剧情片\n好于 46% 喜剧片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1287091703.webp","tag":"喜剧,剧情,爱情,惊悚,犯罪","address":" 美国","years":"1998","date":"1998-06-26","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2134972375.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2248633981.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2338566650.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2495511026.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p979534384.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2493238015.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2493238389.webp\"]","descs":"杰克（乔治·克鲁尼 George Clooney 饰）是一名劣迹斑斑又不太走运的江洋大盗，一次作案失败让他不得不面对为期三十年的牢狱之灾，心有不甘的杰克发誓绝不屈服于命运的安排，他决定越狱。 女警探凯伦（詹妮弗·洛佩兹 Jennifer Lopez 饰）出生于执法世家 ，可惜眼光不佳的她却总是栽在坏男人的手里，这不，一次偶然中，她遇见了正在越狱的杰克和伙伴巴迪（文·瑞姆斯 Ving Rhames 饰）并成为了两人的人质。在逃亡的途中，凯伦和杰克之间产生了感情，被迫分离后，亲手将爱人捉拿归案成为了凯伦唯一的理想。一个是运气不佳，一个是眼光不佳，这样两个倒霉蛋之间会擦出怎样的火花呢？ ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/18JRJXtFqpHgGcJz_fOD6JQ?pwd=f5mg\",\"size\":\"0.856\",\"date\":\"2025-08-11\",\"type\":0,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1096,"title":"芙蓉镇","ratingNum":9.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2575337180.webp","tag":"No.200豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 中国大陆","years":"1987","date":"1987-03-05(中国大陆上海首映)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459948603.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459948269.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1043529125.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p459947915.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2375070783.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2174804034.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img2.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2174882541.webp\"]","descs":"本片分上下两集，讲述了位于湘、粤、桂三省交界处的芙蓉镇上，人称“芙蓉姐”的漂亮女人胡玉音（刘晓庆）在“四清运动”及“文化大革命”中的遭遇。\n　　1963年，凭着热情周到的服务，胡玉音与丈夫桂桂（刘利年）经营的米豆腐摊子前渐渐成为早市上最热闹的一道风景，加上夫妻俩省吃俭用，手中积攒了一 笔数目可观的财富。镇党支书也是胡玉音干哥的黎满庚（张光北）、粮站主任谷燕山（郑在石）及乡邻们都为他们高兴。当他们盖好新房准备日子更上一层楼时，迎上“四清运动”，一直嫉妒胡玉音的原国营饮食店经理、今县商业局科长李国香（徐松子）与二流子王秋赦（祝士彬）联手，趁机将她定性为“反革命五类分子”中的“富农婆”，将之派去与原县文化馆馆长、今被人称作“秦癫子”的“右派”秦书田（姜文）一起清扫大街，桂桂身亡。运动中黎满庚昧着良心将胡玉音背叛，谷燕山则一直以老革命军人的标准诚实做人。\n　　196... (展开全部) ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1OZU035WKc40bD3Z8Vlwd7Q?pwd=9a3n\",\"size\":\"3.4\",\"date\":\"2025-07-23\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1102,"title":"城市之光 City Lights","ratingNum":9.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 99% 喜剧片\n好于 98% 剧情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p2170238828.webp","tag":"No.210豆瓣电影Top250","address":" 美国","years":"1931","date":"1931-01-30(洛杉矶首映)、1931-03-07(美国)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p902054394.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2561548684.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2170238828.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1828169202.webp\"]","descs":"他是一个流浪汉（查理·卓别林 Charles Chaplin 饰），身无分文，遇上了双目失明的卖花女，却不忍袖手旁观。他想尽办法去凑够费用，供卖花女治病。一天，他搭救了一个富翁，富翁当晚和他称兄道弟，第二天却翻脸不认人。本来打算向他求助的主意行不通了。流浪汉去参加拳击比 赛，以图获得奖金，却输得一败涂地。谁知这时重遇富翁，二人不计前嫌，富翁答应出钱资助卖花女。在交给流浪汉1000元后，富翁遭到偷袭，身上剩下的钱被强盗抢走。流浪汉奋不顾身去追赶，却因为误会被警察押回警局坐牢。另一方面，卖花女凭借流浪汉的资助重获光明，开了一家体面的花店。 ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/1O4NiuB3W5sQGrlC6xYVbFQ?pwd=9a3n\",\"size\":\"1\",\"date\":\"2025-07-23\",\"type\":5,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1486,"title":"灿烂人生 La meglio gioventù","ratingNum":9.3,"ratingbetterthan":"好于 98% 剧情片\n好于 99% 爱情片\n","imgs":"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/s_ratio_poster/public/p1161132422.webp","tag":"No.18|欧洲爱情片榜","address":" 意大利","years":"2003","date":"2003-05-20(戛纳电影节)、2003-06-20(意大利)","photos":"[\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img9.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2391607016.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1065576158.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2533776739.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1643934319.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1643934373.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1161132422.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img3.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p1643917533.webp\",\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=img1.doubanio.com/view/photo/l/public/p2893437749.webp\"]","descs":"马里奥（阿莱西奥•博尼 Alessio Boni 饰）和尼古拉（卢伊吉洛•肖卡 Luigi Lo Cascio 饰）是亲密无间的两兄弟，但是酷爱诗歌的马里奥却在考试中因为与教授意见相左而不及格，相反尼古拉投其所好的表现赢得了医学教授的好评拿到了高分。他们几个朋友相约去毕 业旅行，但是马里奥却带来了另外一个不速之客——他从精神病院搭救出来受伤的女孩佐珍（杰丝敏•特丽卡 Jasmine Trinca 饰）。于是，兄弟俩决定陪她寻找亲人。在一片革命洪流之中，马里奥弃笔从戎，选择做警察，而尼古拉则漂泊异乡成为了精神科医生。佛罗伦萨的大水，让兄弟俩重逢，此时尼古拉已经和钢琴师朱莉安成为伉俪。而马里奥则对摄影师米雷拉一见钟情。他们的感情同样经受着社会动荡的考验……\n　　本片片长6个小时，通过讲述意大利一家人的悲欢离合，反映了意大利从1966年至2000年的社会巨变。... (展开全部) ","shareUrl":"[{\"shareType\":1,\"url\":\"https://pan.baidu.com/s/15qb7whBNRSYtVPngLp-pwQ?pwd=eba8\",\"size\":\"3.55\",\"date\":\"2025-09-17\",\"type\":4,\"isZn\":true}]"},{"id":1388,"title":"三傻大闹宝莱坞 3 Idiots","ratingNum":9.2,"